 about:{title:'About Digitalivez Tools',intro:'Smarter tools. Better business decisions.',body:['Digitalivez Tools is a free toolkit for small business owners, freelancers, entrepreneurs, and independent professionals. We build practical calculators and generators that make everyday business decisions easier to understand.','Our tools are designed to be straightforward, useful, and privacy-conscious. Calculations happen in your browser, no registration is required, and currency selectors never imply an exchange rate.','Digitalivez Tools is part of the Digitalivez brand. We aim to make accessible, clear business resources for people working around the world.']},
 contact:{title:'Contact Digitalivez Tools',intro:'Questions, corrections, or ideas for a tool? We welcome thoughtful feedback.',body:['Email us at contact@digitalivez.com.','When reporting a calculator issue, include the tool name, the inputs you used, and what result you expected. Please do not send sensitive client or financial information.']},
 privacy:{title:'Privacy Policy',intro:'A straightforward overview of how this website handles information.',body:['Calculator inputs and document details are processed in your browser. The tools do not require an account and do not send the values you enter to a calculator service. Document details are not stored by Digitalivez Tools; use your device’s print dialog to print or save a PDF.','In production, this site loads Vercel Analytics, Google Analytics 4, and Meta Pixel only after you accept Analytics and Cookies. Vercel Analytics and Google Analytics measure site usage; Meta Pixel helps measure page views and advertising performance. These services may receive page views and browser or device identifiers. You can reject or change that choice in Cookie settings, and your preference is stored in a first-party cookie for six months. The live hosting layer also loads a Cloudflare Insights beacon, which is configured outside this app and is not controlled by the consent setting here. See Meta’s privacy policy for how Meta handles information it receives.','Links to other websites are governed by those websites’ own privacy policies. This page is general information, not legal advice.']},
 terms:{title:'Terms of Use',intro:'Please use these tools as practical aids, not as a substitute for your own judgment.',body:['Digitalivez Tools is provided for general informational and planning purposes. You are responsible for verifying inputs, outputs, applicable taxes, and local requirements before acting on a result.','We do not guarantee that every estimate will fit your particular business circumstances. The tools are provided without a promise of uninterrupted availability, to the extent permitted by applicable law.','Do not use this website in a way that disrupts its operation or infringes the rights of others. These terms may be updated as the service changes.']},
 disclaimer:{title:'Disclaimer',intro:'Business calculations are estimates, and the context matters.',body:['Results from these tools are for general information and planning only. They are not financial, accounting, tax, legal, or investment advice. Consider consulting an appropriately qualified professional for decisions that affect your business.','Late-payment fee estimates do not determine whether a charge is permitted, enforceable, or appropriate. Rules vary by contract and jurisdiction.','Check all figures and assumptions independently before relying on them. Digitalivez Tools does not guarantee a particular business outcome.']}
